@startuml view-cnc-client-server-state
!include plantuml-theme.puml
title NewsItem status lifecycle (UML state machine)
state DRAFT
state PUBLISHED
state ARCHIVED
[*] --> DRAFT : POST /api/news (UC-1)
DRAFT --> PUBLISHED : PATCH .../publish (UC-4)
DRAFT --> ARCHIVED : PATCH .../archive (UC-4)
PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED : PATCH .../archive (UC-4)
ARCHIVED --> PUBLISHED : PATCH .../publish (UC-4)
DRAFT --> [*] : DELETE (UC-5)
PUBLISHED --> [*] : DELETE (UC-5)
ARCHIVED --> [*] : DELETE (UC-5)
DRAFT : PUT edits title and content (UC-3)
PUBLISHED : PUT edits title and content (UC-3)
ARCHIVED : PUT edits title and content (UC-3)
note right of ARCHIVED #F6E4E4
  Open question: the API rejects no
  transition, so an archived item
  can be published again.
end note
@enduml
